cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the benchmark in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: >-
  sdtmrag: a benchmark and evaluation protocol for document-grounded assistants
  over CDISC SDTM/SDTMIG laboratory data standards
abstract: >-
  Retrieval-augmented question answering over the CDISC Study Data Tabulation
  Model and its Implementation Guide, with a PDF text cleaning module, a
  heading-aware chunker, local ONNX embeddings and a cross-encoder reranker, and
  a benchmark of 193 English questions whose locators are verbatim passages
  rather than chunk identifiers. The repository contains the lexical (BM25),
  dense and hybrid retrieval baselines, the closed-book control, the benchmark
  construction and verification scripts, and the statistical analysis that
  produces every number reported in the paper.
type: software
license: MIT
keywords:
